# cpmtools' definition of the H17 disk Heath/Zenith CP/M 2.2.04 uses: 40 tracks of ten 256-byte sectors, hard
# sectored, 1 KB blocks, 64 directory entries, the system on the first three tracks (appmake's hz89; z88dk's
# skew table 0 4 8 2 6 1 5 9 3 7 is cpmtools' skew 4). cpmtools reads diskdefs from the current directory.
diskdef h17
  seclen 256
  tracks 40
  sectrk 10
  blocksize 1024
  maxdir 64
  skew 4
  boottrk 3
  os 2.2
end
